"/><title>NEPAL LUXURIOUS TREKKING | NEPAL PRIVATE TOUR | Trips@Asia</title><meta name="description" content="Enjoy luxurious trekking through the foot of the mighty Annapurna on this Nepal private tour. Track wildlife in Chitwan Nature Reserve and join the crowds as they take to Kathmandu&#x27;s bustling streets to celebrate the annual Indra Jatra Festival. This trip is a fantastic opportunity for those looking to experience mild trekking in Nepal, or for families wanting to spend time trekking together while enjoying some of the coziest lodging facilities Nepal has to offer.

